;; Card d28f118e (Brindle S9): the cornered options go cheapest first, the stand priced with every mob that hits it. A pit 5x5,
;; 3 deep, cut in a stone mass; the body in it unarmed with 16 dirt and resistance, facing (yaw 270, east) a NoAI creeper 2 off:
;; a creeper is silent, so out of the view cone it is never known. Every answer pays the blast of a creeper already in swell
;; range; the stand also holds for a whole hide, so a cover (walls or a pillar out of the pit) is cheaper by a clear margin.
;; Should-fail (the stand): no :pause hold before a cover starts.
{:defaults
 {:tags [:hostile :survival :cornered :creeper]
  :time :any
  :mobs :keep
  :register [{:trigger :hostile-near}]
  :blocks [[:fill [2 0 8] [20 3 22] "stone"]
           [:fill [8 1 13] [12 3 17] "air"]]
  :body {:at [9.5 1 15.5] :yaw 270 :effects [["resistance" 600 3]] :inventory [["dirt" 16]]}
  :limit-s 45}
 :cases
 [{:name "cornered-beside-a-creeper-in-swell-range-covers-before-it-stands"
   :act [[:summon "creeper" [11.5 1 15.5] "{NoAI:1b}"]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot #{:plug :pillar}}} :within-s 30}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot :pause}} :for-s 30 :until {:source :job :kind :child_started :data {:slot #{:plug :pillar}}}}]}]}
